# ThemeBulletin Git ignore rules
# Author: Alysha Pursley
# Purpose: Keeps local secrets, editor state, operating-system files, logs, and temporary files out of version control.
# Role: Protects repository hygiene while leaving the complete static website source, assets, data, and documentation trackable.

# Local environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / IDE state
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
